  "slug": "banquet-order-post-event-review-form",
  "title": "Banquet Order Post-Event Review Form",
  "subtitle": "Close the function: reconcile guarantee against covers served, measure the timeline actuals, record client feedback, and close billing.",
  "description": "An original post-function review for a banquet. It reconciles ordered, guaranteed, set, served, and billed counts, measures the service timeline against plan, records the client outcome and any complaint, opens actions for findings, and captures the learning that should change the next banquet event order.",
  "use_case": "Use after a banquet function when banquets, culinary, and accounting must agree on what was served and what is billable, and when the team needs to know where the timeline slipped. The review closes when billing is agreed and every finding has an owner.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
